{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>We STRONGLY recommand that you have basic of Ancient Chinese (Wen-yan \u6587\u8a00) reading to understand the plot!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/92a07330ae93795ab7eb13876843daf5.avif?t=1771419265\" alt=\"Introduction\" width=568 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a &quot;fictional, but plausible&quot; strategy role-playing game with a plot which can be regarded as a history of the Three Kingdoms in a different realm. Let's imagine that the main character, &quot;Liao Hao&quot;, existed in the Eastern Han Dynasty at that time, but because of a little difference in choices, this story is different from the main history, and creates a &quot;parallel universe&quot;. The plot of this game is to tell the history of the Three Kingdoms from this person's point of view, which does not exist in this realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therefore, you may find that the plot in the early part of the game can still be called the familiar story of the Three Kingdoms, but the later the storyline, the more different from the realm, many characters that have little or no mention in the history may also blossom in this very different time and space with a different light. If you are still interested in reading this anecdote, you may want to give it a try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u8fd9\u662f\u4e00\u6b3e\u300c\u865a\u6784\u7684\uff0c\u4f46\u4e5f\u5e94\u5f53\u662f\u5408\u7406\u7684\u4e09\u56fd\u80cc\u666f\u7684\u300d\u6218\u68cb\u7c7b\u6e38\u620f\uff0c\u53c8\u4f3c\u53ef\u5c06\u5b83\u770b\u4f5c\u662f\u4e00\u6bb5\u5f02\u4f4d\u9762\u7684\u4e09\u56fd\u5386\u53f2\u3002\u6211\u4eec\u4e0d\u59a8\u8bbe\u60f3\uff0c\u4e3b\u4eba\u516c\u2014\u2014\u300c\u5ed6\u8c6a\u300d\u672c\u5c31\u5b58\u5728\u4e8e\u5f7c\u65f6\u7684\u4e1c\u6c49\uff0c\u53ea\u662f\u56e0\u4e3a\u4e00\u70b9\u70b9\u9009\u62e9\u4e0a\u7684\u4e0d\u540c\uff0c\u9042\u5f62\u6210\u4e86\u8fd9\u4e2a\u4e0e\u6b63\u53f2\u5224\u7136\u6709\u522b\u7684\u6545\u4e8b\uff0c\u4ea6\u9020\u5c31\u4e86\u4e00\u4e2a\u300c\u5e73\u884c\u5b87\u5b99\u300d\u3002\u800c\u8fd9\u4e2a\u6e38\u620f\u7684\u5267\u60c5\uff0c\u5c31\u662f\u4ee5\u6b64\u4eba\u7684\u89c6\u89d2\u6765\u8bb2\u8ff0\u4e00\u6bb5\u672c\u4f4d\u9762\u4e2d\u5e76\u4e0d\u5b58\u5728\u7684\u4e09\u56fd\u5386\u53f2\u3002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u56e0\u800c\u8bf8\u541b\u6216\u5c06\u53d1\u73b0\uff0c\u6e38\u620f\u524d\u671f\u7684\u5267\u60c5\u5c1a\u53ef\u79f0\u4f5c\u8f83\u4e3a\u719f\u77e5\u7684\u4e09\u56fd\u6545\u4e8b\uff0c\u4f46\u662f\u5267\u60c5\u6108\u540e\uff0c\u548c\u672c\u4f4d\u9762\u5dee\u522b\u6108\u5927\uff0c\u8bb8\u591a\u5728\u6b63\u53f2\u4e0a\u7740\u58a8\u751a\u5c11\u4e43\u81f3\u5be5\u5be5\u6570\u7b14\u7684\u4eba\u7269\uff0c\u4ea6\u53ef\u80fd\u5728\u8fd9\u6bb5\u8fe5\u5f02\u7684\u65f6\u7a7a\u4e2d\u7efd\u653e\u51fa\u522b\u6837\u7684\u5149\u8292\u3002\u82e5\u8bf8\u541b\u4ecd\u6709\u5174\u8da3\u4e00\u89c8\u8fd9\u9619\u4e8e\u53f2\u7c4d\u4e4b\u8f76\u95fb\uff0c\u4e0d\u59a8\u4e00\u8bd5\u3002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/60ee9fac184b7530340cb78cc60b5a13.poster.avif?t=1771419265\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/60ee9fac184b7530340cb78cc60b5a13.webm?t=1771419265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/60ee9fac184b7530340cb78cc60b5a13.mp4?t=1771419265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/542b3db609dde82bffddd0ec188d6927.avif?t=1771419265\" alt=\"Features\" width=568 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will experience those in the current version of this game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 25 hours of gameplay with 50 levels of different styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 450,000 words (Chinese characters) of plot text, with more than two hundreds historical figures from the Eastern Han Dynasty to the Three Kingdoms acting out the stories of this history. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Scripts, chronicles and biographies written with reference to a large number of original documents and scholars' writings, experiencing a &quot;logical&quot; fictional story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique strategy system different from Sangokushi Eiketsuden, Sangokushi Caocaoden ( Story of Cao Cao ) and Fire Emblems, freely train your troops by adding points and transferring to other positions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet certain conditions to open four miniature branching levels to experience different events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of weapons, treasures and a unique strategy system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different difficulties settings to suit different players, from drama fans to wargame enthusiasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the hidden elements in each level and achieve 44 Steam Achievements!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u5728\u76ee\u524d\u7248\u672c\u7684\u6e38\u620f\u4e2d\uff0c\u60a8\u5c06\u4f1a\u4f53\u9a8c\u5230\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u81f3\u5c1125\u5c0f\u65f6\u7684\u6e38\u620f\u65f6\u957f\uff0c\u5305\u542b50\u4e2a\u98ce\u683c\u5404\u5f02\u7684\u5173\u5361</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u903e45\u4e07\u5b57\u7684\u5267\u60c5\u6587\u672c\uff0c\u4e00\u767e\u4f59\u540d\u540e\u6c49\u4e09\u56fd\u5386\u53f2\u4eba\u7269\u6f14\u51fa\u7684\u6c49\u672b\u5f02\u95fb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u53c2\u8003\u5927\u91cf\u539f\u59cb\u6587\u732e\u4e0e\u5b66\u8005\u8457\u8ff0\u800c\u7f16\u5199\u7684\u5267\u672c\u3001\u4e8b\u5178\u4e0e\u5217\u4f20\uff0c\u4f53\u9a8c\u300c\u5408\u4e4e\u903b\u8f91\u300d\u7684\u865a\u6784\u6545\u4e8b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u4e0e\u300a\u66f9\u64cd\u4f20\u300b\u300a\u706b\u7130\u4e4b\u7eb9\u7ae0\u300b\u5747\u6709\u5dee\u5f02\u7684\u72ec\u7279\u7b56\u7565\u7cfb\u7edf\uff0c\u901a\u8fc7\u52a0\u70b9\u548c\u8f6c\u804c\u7cfb\u7edf\u81ea\u7531\u57f9\u517b\u60a8\u7684\u90e8\u961f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u6ee1\u8db3\u7279\u5b9a\u6761\u4ef6\u4ee5\u5f00\u542f\u56db\u4e2a\u5c0f\u578b\u5206\u652f\u5173\u5361\uff0c\u4f53\u9a8c\u4e0d\u540c\u7684\u4e8b\u4ef6</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u6570\u91cf\u7e41\u591a\u7684\u6b66\u5668\u3001\u5b9d\u7269\u548c\u7279\u6709\u7684\u519b\u7565\u7cfb\u7edf</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u54b8\u5b9c\u4e8e\u4e0d\u540c\u73a9\u5bb6\u7684\u96be\u5ea6\u8bbe\u7f6e\uff0c\u81ea\u5267\u60c5\u7231\u597d\u8005\u5230\u6218\u68cb\u6df1\u5ea6\u73a9\u5bb6\u7686\u53ef\u4f9d\u81ea\u8eab\u9700\u6c42\u4f53\u9a8c\u6e38\u620f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u53d1\u6398\u5404\u5173\u5361\u4e2d\u7684\u9690\u85cf\u8981\u7d20\uff0c\u8fbe\u621044\u4e2aSteam\u6210\u5c31</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/14117ef06ba02237ce8ee1f552e6b8a3.poster.avif?t=1771419265\" width=450 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/14117ef06ba02237ce8ee1f552e6b8a3.webm?t=1771419265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/14117ef06ba02237ce8ee1f552e6b8a3.mp4?t=1771419265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/c531b56ecce01a3722accb50eb016030.poster.avif?t=1771419265\" width=260 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/c531b56ecce01a3722accb50eb016030.webm?t=1771419265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/c531b56ecce01a3722accb50eb016030.mp4?t=1771419265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/c76acae89d43a17e3bdddb469a684552.poster.avif?t=1771419265\" width=460 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/c76acae89d43a17e3bdddb469a684552.webm?t=1771419265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/c76acae89d43a17e3bdddb469a684552.mp4?t=1771419265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/3d155d05edee32911c6370678f794e6b.avif?t=1771419265\" alt=\"Note\" width=568 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firstly, thank you for viewing this page, this game, and for being willing to browse the introduction until here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secondly, it should be noted that this is a game with a very limited (almost no) budget and produced by SRPG Studio. The author is of course aware that it is just one of the countless indie games, neither outstanding nor great, and may not have any 'edifying' effect. The only difference probably is that it can be called as &quot;the work of the author's heart&quot;. However, what can be guaranteed is that this game is at least not too different from SS's native FE-like system. However, the author should warn you of the fact that the poor graphic performance (i.e., a consequence of &quot;limited funds&quot;). If you can tolerate this, please give the game a try!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then there's the question of why the RMB price is \u00a59.69: 10 and 9.99 are both tacky, so we cut it down by 30 cents, and the price also represents the &quot;unfinished&quot; graphic in Zhou Yi - i.e., it's the current state of being a pre-release. (After all, we're too embarrassed to set the price at \uffe56,767.67, aren't we?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, DRM-Free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, apparently Steam has not considered the QQ group this feedback method, then here is the feedback with QQ group number: 566209337.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u9996\u5148\uff0c\u611f\u8c22\u60a8\u770b\u5230\u8fd9\u4e2a\u9875\u9762\uff0c\u8fd9\u6b3e\u6e38\u620f\uff0c\u5e76\u613f\u610f\u6d4f\u89c8\u4ecb\u7ecd\u76f4\u5230\u8fd9\u91cc\u3002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u5176\u6b21\uff0c\u9700\u8981\u6307\u51fa\u7684\u662f\uff0c\u8fd9\u662f\u4e00\u6b3e\u7ecf\u8d39\u6709\u9650\uff08\u5eb6\u51e0\u4e4e\u65e0\uff09\uff0c\u4e14\u662f\u7531SRPG Studio\u5236\u4f5c\u7684\u6e38\u620f\u3002\u4f5c\u8005\u5f53\u7136\u77e5\u9053\u5b83\u4ec5\u4ec5\u662f\u65e0\u6570\u72ec\u7acb\u6e38\u620f\u4e2d\u7684\u4e00\u5458\uff0c\u65e2\u4e0d\u7a81\u51fa\uff0c\u4ea6\u4e0d\u4f1f\u5927\uff0c\u66f4\u672a\u5fc5\u6709\u4ec0\u4e48\u300c\u6559\u5316\u300d\u7684\u529f\u6548\uff0c\u82e5\u59d1\u4e14\u627e\u51fa\u4e00\u4e8c\u5dee\u5f02\uff0c\u5927\u62b5\u662f\u4f5c\u8005\u5c1a\u53ef\u62cd\u62cd\u80f8\u812f\uff0c\u800c\u540e\u79f0\u5176\u4e3a\u300c\u672c\u5fc3\u4e4b\u4f5c\u300d\uff1b\u7136\u800c\u53ef\u4ee5\u4fdd\u8bc1\u7684\u662f\uff0c\u8fd9\u6b3e\u6e38\u620f\u81f3\u5c11\u548cSS\u539f\u751f\u7684\u7c7b\u706b\u7eb9\u7cfb\u7edf\u6709\u7740\u4e0d\u5c0f\u7684\u5dee\u522b\u3002\u4f46\u5176\u753b\u9762\u672a\u80fd\u8131\u79bbSS\u4e4b\u7aa0\u81fc\uff08\u4ea6\u5373\u300c\u7ecf\u8d39\u6709\u9650\u300d\u4e4b\u540e\u679c\uff09\uff0c\u8fd9\u4e00\u70b9\u4ea6\u662f\u9700\u8981\u9884\u5148\u8b66\u9192\u4e8e\u60a8\u7684\u3002\u82e5\u60a8\u5bf9\u753b\u9762\u7684\u4e0d\u8db3\u4e4b\u5904\u53ef\u4ee5\u5305\u5bb9\u7684\u8bdd\uff0c\u5c31\u8bf7\u4f53\u9a8c\u4e00\u4e0b\u8fd9\u6b3e\u6e38\u620f\u7f62\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u7136\u540e\uff0c\u5173\u4e8e\u4eba\u6c11\u5e01\u5b9a\u4ef7\u4e3a\u4f55\u662f\uffe59.69\u8fd9\u4e48\u4e2a\u6709\u96f6\u6709\u6574\u7684\u6570\u5b57\uff1a10\u548c9.99\u90fd\u592a\u4fd7\uff0c\u6240\u4ee5\u780d\u4e86\u4e09\u6bdb\u94b1\uff1b\u6b64\u5916\uff0c\u8fd9\u4e2a\u4ef7\u683c\u4e5f\u4ee3\u8868\u7740\u300c\u706b\u6c34\u672a\u6d4e\u300d\u2014\u2014\u5373\u76ee\u524d\u62a2\u5148\u4f53\u9a8c\u7684\u72b6\u6001\u3002\uff08\u6bd5\u7adf\u54b1\u4eec\u4e5f\u4e0d\u597d\u610f\u601d\u5b9a\uffe56767.67\u4e0d\u662f\uff1f\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u6b64\u5916\uff0cDRM-Free\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u6700\u540e\uff0c\u663e\u7136Steam\u6ca1\u6709\u8003\u8651\u8fc7QQ\u7fa4\u8fd9\u79cd\u53cd\u9988\u65b9\u5f0f\uff0c\u90a3\u4e48\u8fd9\u91cc\u662f\u53cd\u9988\u7528\u7684QQ\u7fa4\u53f7\uff1a566209337\u3002</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A wind came forth | \u5927\u98ce\u8d77\u516e","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2010900/d238f720cd4839e08e0c718c5ff91003bace8d7c.jpg"},{"name":"Swan away from homeland | \u9e44\u7ffc\u5357\u7fd4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2010900/6d9c4492047b779cad076b371b978888bfd5e395.jpg"},{"name":"When the eagle soars | \u65f6\u7ef4\u9e70\u626c","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2010900/7796a4d9029e7bf1fd469af9234e38ce257a8d68.jpg"},{"name":"A rhapsody with sword | \u5f39\u94d7\u72c2\u6b4c","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2010900/4e50db948c5f253683a8f25dd505ac8018bbeec5.jpg"},{"name":"The mid night still | \u957f\u591c\u672a\u592e","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2010900/682c1ff70e50ffb4bbc44d985546448af3d40b28.jpg"},{"name":"A Paradox of Whiggish history | \u8f89\u683c\u53f2\u7684\u6096\u8bba","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2010900/45f292bd689deb6546d5aeaccf133e5541592acb.jpg"},{"name":"On your merit for Wei Dynasty | \u9b4f\u4e4b\u5143\u529f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2010900/1441fbccced129c2bc607f038e3fe095151df995.jpg"},{"name":"On your merit for Jin Dynasty | \u4ece\u9f99\u4e4b\u52cb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2010900/0749e3e9da8e5bee9fd964267e463f16940e18b5.jpg"},{"name":"Captain of Tiger Vanguards | \u864e\u536b\u961f\u957f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2010900/09ed82be51695b7184f89af2d96df56ab2e5cde1.jpg"},{"name":"Dynasty Warriors | \u65e0\u53cc\u6218\u795e","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2010900/92a08c2e48f67b2e94eb70ec176806431309dfd0.jpg"}],"total":53},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2010900?t=1771419265","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771419265","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/8067bf94b58b33e00d1ce6f0f7a0ddaac9f2fc1a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771419265","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/8067bf94b58b33e00d1ce6f0f7a0ddaac9f2fc1a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771419265","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>We STRONGLY recommand that you have basic of Ancient Chinese (Wen-yan \u6587\u8a00) reading to understand the plot!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/92a07330ae93795ab7eb13876843daf5.avif?t=1771419265\" alt=\"Introduction\" width=568 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a &quot;fictional, but plausible&quot; strategy role-playing game with a plot which can be regarded as a history of the Three Kingdoms in a different realm. Let's imagine that the main character, &quot;Liao Hao&quot;, existed in the Eastern Han Dynasty at that time, but because of a little difference in choices, this story is different from the main history, and creates a &quot;parallel universe&quot;. The plot of this game is to tell the history of the Three Kingdoms from this person's point of view, which does not exist in this realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therefore, you may find that the plot in the early part of the game can still be called the familiar story of the Three Kingdoms, but the later the storyline, the more different from the realm, many characters that have little or no mention in the history may also blossom in this very different time and space with a different light. If you are still interested in reading this anecdote, you may want to give it a try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u8fd9\u662f\u4e00\u6b3e\u300c\u865a\u6784\u7684\uff0c\u4f46\u4e5f\u5e94\u5f53\u662f\u5408\u7406\u7684\u4e09\u56fd\u80cc\u666f\u7684\u300d\u6218\u68cb\u7c7b\u6e38\u620f\uff0c\u53c8\u4f3c\u53ef\u5c06\u5b83\u770b\u4f5c\u662f\u4e00\u6bb5\u5f02\u4f4d\u9762\u7684\u4e09\u56fd\u5386\u53f2\u3002\u6211\u4eec\u4e0d\u59a8\u8bbe\u60f3\uff0c\u4e3b\u4eba\u516c\u2014\u2014\u300c\u5ed6\u8c6a\u300d\u672c\u5c31\u5b58\u5728\u4e8e\u5f7c\u65f6\u7684\u4e1c\u6c49\uff0c\u53ea\u662f\u56e0\u4e3a\u4e00\u70b9\u70b9\u9009\u62e9\u4e0a\u7684\u4e0d\u540c\uff0c\u9042\u5f62\u6210\u4e86\u8fd9\u4e2a\u4e0e\u6b63\u53f2\u5224\u7136\u6709\u522b\u7684\u6545\u4e8b\uff0c\u4ea6\u9020\u5c31\u4e86\u4e00\u4e2a\u300c\u5e73\u884c\u5b87\u5b99\u300d\u3002\u800c\u8fd9\u4e2a\u6e38\u620f\u7684\u5267\u60c5\uff0c\u5c31\u662f\u4ee5\u6b64\u4eba\u7684\u89c6\u89d2\u6765\u8bb2\u8ff0\u4e00\u6bb5\u672c\u4f4d\u9762\u4e2d\u5e76\u4e0d\u5b58\u5728\u7684\u4e09\u56fd\u5386\u53f2\u3002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u56e0\u800c\u8bf8\u541b\u6216\u5c06\u53d1\u73b0\uff0c\u6e38\u620f\u524d\u671f\u7684\u5267\u60c5\u5c1a\u53ef\u79f0\u4f5c\u8f83\u4e3a\u719f\u77e5\u7684\u4e09\u56fd\u6545\u4e8b\uff0c\u4f46\u662f\u5267\u60c5\u6108\u540e\uff0c\u548c\u672c\u4f4d\u9762\u5dee\u522b\u6108\u5927\uff0c\u8bb8\u591a\u5728\u6b63\u53f2\u4e0a\u7740\u58a8\u751a\u5c11\u4e43\u81f3\u5be5\u5be5\u6570\u7b14\u7684\u4eba\u7269\uff0c\u4ea6\u53ef\u80fd\u5728\u8fd9\u6bb5\u8fe5\u5f02\u7684\u65f6\u7a7a\u4e2d\u7efd\u653e\u51fa\u522b\u6837\u7684\u5149\u8292\u3002\u82e5\u8bf8\u541b\u4ecd\u6709\u5174\u8da3\u4e00\u89c8\u8fd9\u9619\u4e8e\u53f2\u7c4d\u4e4b\u8f76\u95fb\uff0c\u4e0d\u59a8\u4e00\u8bd5\u3002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/60ee9fac184b7530340cb78cc60b5a13.poster.avif?t=1771419265\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/60ee9fac184b7530340cb78cc60b5a13.webm?t=1771419265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/60ee9fac184b7530340cb78cc60b5a13.mp4?t=1771419265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/542b3db609dde82bffddd0ec188d6927.avif?t=1771419265\" alt=\"Features\" width=568 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will experience those in the current version of this game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 25 hours of gameplay with 50 levels of different styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 450,000 words (Chinese characters) of plot text, with more than two hundreds historical figures from the Eastern Han Dynasty to the Three Kingdoms acting out the stories of this history. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Scripts, chronicles and biographies written with reference to a large number of original documents and scholars' writings, experiencing a &quot;logical&quot; fictional story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique strategy system different from Sangokushi Eiketsuden, Sangokushi Caocaoden ( Story of Cao Cao ) and Fire Emblems, freely train your troops by adding points and transferring to other positions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet certain conditions to open four miniature branching levels to experience different events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of weapons, treasures and a unique strategy system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different difficulties settings to suit different players, from drama fans to wargame enthusiasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the hidden elements in each level and achieve 44 Steam Achievements!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u5728\u76ee\u524d\u7248\u672c\u7684\u6e38\u620f\u4e2d\uff0c\u60a8\u5c06\u4f1a\u4f53\u9a8c\u5230\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u81f3\u5c1125\u5c0f\u65f6\u7684\u6e38\u620f\u65f6\u957f\uff0c\u5305\u542b50\u4e2a\u98ce\u683c\u5404\u5f02\u7684\u5173\u5361</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u903e45\u4e07\u5b57\u7684\u5267\u60c5\u6587\u672c\uff0c\u4e00\u767e\u4f59\u540d\u540e\u6c49\u4e09\u56fd\u5386\u53f2\u4eba\u7269\u6f14\u51fa\u7684\u6c49\u672b\u5f02\u95fb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u53c2\u8003\u5927\u91cf\u539f\u59cb\u6587\u732e\u4e0e\u5b66\u8005\u8457\u8ff0\u800c\u7f16\u5199\u7684\u5267\u672c\u3001\u4e8b\u5178\u4e0e\u5217\u4f20\uff0c\u4f53\u9a8c\u300c\u5408\u4e4e\u903b\u8f91\u300d\u7684\u865a\u6784\u6545\u4e8b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u4e0e\u300a\u66f9\u64cd\u4f20\u300b\u300a\u706b\u7130\u4e4b\u7eb9\u7ae0\u300b\u5747\u6709\u5dee\u5f02\u7684\u72ec\u7279\u7b56\u7565\u7cfb\u7edf\uff0c\u901a\u8fc7\u52a0\u70b9\u548c\u8f6c\u804c\u7cfb\u7edf\u81ea\u7531\u57f9\u517b\u60a8\u7684\u90e8\u961f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u6ee1\u8db3\u7279\u5b9a\u6761\u4ef6\u4ee5\u5f00\u542f\u56db\u4e2a\u5c0f\u578b\u5206\u652f\u5173\u5361\uff0c\u4f53\u9a8c\u4e0d\u540c\u7684\u4e8b\u4ef6</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u6570\u91cf\u7e41\u591a\u7684\u6b66\u5668\u3001\u5b9d\u7269\u548c\u7279\u6709\u7684\u519b\u7565\u7cfb\u7edf</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u54b8\u5b9c\u4e8e\u4e0d\u540c\u73a9\u5bb6\u7684\u96be\u5ea6\u8bbe\u7f6e\uff0c\u81ea\u5267\u60c5\u7231\u597d\u8005\u5230\u6218\u68cb\u6df1\u5ea6\u73a9\u5bb6\u7686\u53ef\u4f9d\u81ea\u8eab\u9700\u6c42\u4f53\u9a8c\u6e38\u620f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u53d1\u6398\u5404\u5173\u5361\u4e2d\u7684\u9690\u85cf\u8981\u7d20\uff0c\u8fbe\u621044\u4e2aSteam\u6210\u5c31</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/14117ef06ba02237ce8ee1f552e6b8a3.poster.avif?t=1771419265\" width=450 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/14117ef06ba02237ce8ee1f552e6b8a3.webm?t=1771419265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/14117ef06ba02237ce8ee1f552e6b8a3.mp4?t=1771419265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/c531b56ecce01a3722accb50eb016030.poster.avif?t=1771419265\" width=260 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/c531b56ecce01a3722accb50eb016030.webm?t=1771419265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/c531b56ecce01a3722accb50eb016030.mp4?t=1771419265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/c76acae89d43a17e3bdddb469a684552.poster.avif?t=1771419265\" width=460 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/c76acae89d43a17e3bdddb469a684552.webm?t=1771419265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/c76acae89d43a17e3bdddb469a684552.mp4?t=1771419265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010900/extras/3d155d05edee32911c6370678f794e6b.avif?t=1771419265\" alt=\"Note\" width=568 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firstly, thank you for viewing this page, this game, and for being willing to browse the introduction until here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secondly, it should be noted that this is a game with a very limited (almost no) budget and produced by SRPG Studio. The author is of course aware that it is just one of the countless indie games, neither outstanding nor great, and may not have any 'edifying' effect. The only difference probably is that it can be called as &quot;the work of the author's heart&quot;. However, what can be guaranteed is that this game is at least not too different from SS's native FE-like system. However, the author should warn you of the fact that the poor graphic performance (i.e., a consequence of &quot;limited funds&quot;). If you can tolerate this, please give the game a try!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then there's the question of why the RMB price is \u00a59.69: 10 and 9.99 are both tacky, so we cut it down by 30 cents, and the price also represents the &quot;unfinished&quot; graphic in Zhou Yi - i.e., it's the current state of being a pre-release. (After all, we're too embarrassed to set the price at \uffe56,767.67, aren't we?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, DRM-Free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, apparently Steam has not considered the QQ group this feedback method, then here is the feedback with QQ group number: 566209337.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u9996\u5148\uff0c\u611f\u8c22\u60a8\u770b\u5230\u8fd9\u4e2a\u9875\u9762\uff0c\u8fd9\u6b3e\u6e38\u620f\uff0c\u5e76\u613f\u610f\u6d4f\u89c8\u4ecb\u7ecd\u76f4\u5230\u8fd9\u91cc\u3002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u5176\u6b21\uff0c\u9700\u8981\u6307\u51fa\u7684\u662f\uff0c\u8fd9\u662f\u4e00\u6b3e\u7ecf\u8d39\u6709\u9650\uff08\u5eb6\u51e0\u4e4e\u65e0\uff09\uff0c\u4e14\u662f\u7531SRPG Studio\u5236\u4f5c\u7684\u6e38\u620f\u3002\u4f5c\u8005\u5f53\u7136\u77e5\u9053\u5b83\u4ec5\u4ec5\u662f\u65e0\u6570\u72ec\u7acb\u6e38\u620f\u4e2d\u7684\u4e00\u5458\uff0c\u65e2\u4e0d\u7a81\u51fa\uff0c\u4ea6\u4e0d\u4f1f\u5927\uff0c\u66f4\u672a\u5fc5\u6709\u4ec0\u4e48\u300c\u6559\u5316\u300d\u7684\u529f\u6548\uff0c\u82e5\u59d1\u4e14\u627e\u51fa\u4e00\u4e8c\u5dee\u5f02\uff0c\u5927\u62b5\u662f\u4f5c\u8005\u5c1a\u53ef\u62cd\u62cd\u80f8\u812f\uff0c\u800c\u540e\u79f0\u5176\u4e3a\u300c\u672c\u5fc3\u4e4b\u4f5c\u300d\uff1b\u7136\u800c\u53ef\u4ee5\u4fdd\u8bc1\u7684\u662f\uff0c\u8fd9\u6b3e\u6e38\u62